<title>UK: Metropolitano de Lisboa sets $100 mln 20-year bond.</title>
<headline>Metropolitano de Lisboa sets $100 mln 20-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Merrill Lynch with Banco Finantia as arranger.</p>
<p> BORROWER   METROPOLITANO DE LISBOA</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  FINANCIAL SECURITIES INSURANCE</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	COUPON     7.42	MATURITY    15.OCT.16</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE  L-07.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  50 BP     REOFFER    =	   L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 500	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/PT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  PORTUGAL  TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    50 BP     SELL CONC  NONE	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	SEMI-ANNUAL AMORTISATION AFTER 10 YEARS</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
